{'symbol': 'MMM', 'date': '2020-04-10 12:30:00-04:56', 'title': '3M Files Lawsuit Alleging N95 Price Gouging In New York City', 'text': '3M FILES LAWSUIT ALLEGING N95 PRICE GOUGING IN NEW YORK CITY.3M CO - COMPLAINT SEEKS INJUNCTIVE RELIEF TO REQUIRE PERFORMANCE SUPPLY LLC TO CEASE ITS ACTIVITIES, ALSO REQUESTS DAMAGES.3M - FILED LEGAL ACTION IN FEDERAL COURT IN NEW YORK CITY AGAINST PERFORMANCE SUPPLY LLC, ALLEGING PRICE GOUGING, DECEPTIVE TRADE PRACTICES IN SALES OF N95 RESPIRATORS.'}{'symbol': 'MMM', 'date': '2020-04-10 04:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Hibernia REIT pre-lets space to 3M despite coronavirus uncertainity', 'text': ':HIBERNIA REIT'}{'symbol': 'AAP', 'date': '2020-04-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Advance Auto Parts Provides Covid-19 Business Update', 'text': "ADVANCE AUTO PARTS PROVIDES COVID-19 BUSINESS UPDATE.IN AN EFFORT TO PRESERVE CASH,  HAVE DECREASED REMAINING CAPITAL SPEND FOR 2020 BY OVER 50%.QUARTER TO DATE COMPARABLE STORE SALES FOR TWELVE WEEKS ENDED MARCH 21, 2020 WERE DOWN 3.2% COMPARED TO PRIOR YEAR.ADVANCE AUTO PARTS - REDUCED STORE HOURS OF OPERATION AND STRATEGICALLY CLOSED STORES TEMPORARILY WHERE CAN SERVICE DEMAND FROM ALTERNATIVE LOCATION.AS OF APRIL 4, 2020, COMPANY'S CASH ON HAND WAS APPROXIMATELY $744 MILLION.CO IS WITHDRAWING FULL YEAR FINANCIAL GUIDANCE IT PROVIDED ON FEBRUARY 18, 2020.CO HAS SUSPENDED ITS SHARE REPURCHASE ACTIVITY TO FURTHER PRESERVE CASH."}{'symbol': 'GOOGL', 'date': '2020-04-10 07:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Google France: will comply with latest French FCA regulatory verdict', 'text': ":GOOGLE FRANCE EXECUTIVE SAYS: SINCE THE EUROPEAN COPYRIGHT LAW CAME INTO FORCE IN FRANCE LAST YEAR, WE HAVE BEEN ENGAGING WITH PUBLISHERS TO INCREASE OUR SUPPORT AND INVESTMENT IN NEWS.GOOGLE FRANCE: WE WILL COMPLY WITH THE FRENCH FCA'S ORDER WHILE WE REVIEW IT AND CONTINUE THOSE NEGOTIATIONS."}{'symbol': 'AAL', 'date': '2020-04-10 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'American Airlines Pilots Union Says 715 Pilots Are Taking Early Retirement', 'text': 'AMERICAN AIRLINES PILOTS UNION SAYS 715 PILOTS ARE TAKING EARLY RETIREMENT.'}{'symbol': 'AAL', 'date': '2020-04-10 20:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'U.S. Treasury chief to brief Trump on aviation aid review', 'text': 'Adds comment from AFA president:.'}{'symbol': 'AMT', 'date': '2020-04-10 19:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'American Tower Corp Calls For Redemption All Of Its Outstanding 2.800% Senior Notes', 'text': 'AMERICAN TOWER CORPORATION CALLS FOR REDEMPTION ALL OF ITS OUTSTANDING 2.800% SENIOR NOTES.AMERICAN TOWER CORP - ITS ELECTION TO CALL FOR REDEMPTION ALL OF ITS OUTSTANDING 2.800% SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES DUE 2020.AMERICAN TOWER CORP - REDEMPTION DATE HAS BEEN SET FOR MAY 11, 2020.AMERICAN TOWER CORP - INTENDS TO FUND REDEMPTION WITH BORROWINGS UNDER ITS $2.25 BILLION SENIOR UNSECURED REVOLVING CREDIT FACILITY, AND CASH ON HAND.'}{'symbol': 'BK', 'date': '2020-04-10 20:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Berkshire Hathaway Reports Open Market Sale Of 197,379 Shares Of Bank Of New York Mellon Corp On April 7 At Average Price Of $35.3069', 'text': 'BERKSHIRE HATHAWAY INC REPORTS OPEN MARKET SALE OF 197,379 SHARES OF BANK OF NEW YORK MELLON CORP ON APRIL 7 AT AVERAGE PRICE OF $35.3069 - SEC FILING.BERKSHIRE HATHAWAY INC REPORTS OPEN MARKET SALE OF 634,419 SHARES OF BANK OF NEW YORK MELLON CORP ON APRIL 8 AT AVERAGE PRICE OF $35.569 PER SHARE.BERKSHIRE HATHAWAY INC REPORTS OPEN MARKET SALE OF 37,305 SHARES OF BANK OF NEW YORK MELLON CORP ON APRIL 8 AT AVERAGE PRICE OF $35.8293 PER SHARE.'}{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2020-04-10 18:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Blackrock Says CEO 2019 Total Compensation $24.3 Mln Vs $26.5 Mln In 2018', 'text': "BLACKROCK SAYS CEO LAURENCE FINK'S 2019 TOTAL COMPENSATION WAS $24.3 MILLION VERSUS $26.5 MILLION IN 2018.BLACKROCK INC - PRESIDENT ROBERT S. KAPITO'S 2019 COMPENSATION $19.3 MILLION VERSUS ABOUT $20.8 MILLION IN 2018.BLACKROCK SAYS COO ROBERT GOLDSTEIN'S 2019 TOTAL COMPENSATION WAS $7.9 MILLION VERSUS $7.9 MILLION IN 2018.BLACKROCK INC - CFO GARY S. SHEDLIN'S 2019 COMPENSATION WAS $6.5 MILLION VERSUS $6.6 MILLION IN 2018.BLACKROCK SAYS GLOBAL HEAD OF MULTI-ASSET STRATEGIES AND GLOBAL FIXED INCOME RICHARD KUSHEL'S 2019 TOTAL COMPENSATION WAS $6.6 MILLION VERSUS $6.9 MILLION IN 2018.BLACKROCK INC - RATIO OF CEO’S 2019 ANNUAL TOTAL COMPENSATION TO MEDIAN OF ANNUAL TOTAL COMPENSATION OF ALL EMPLOYEES WAS 182:1."}{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2020-04-10 15:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Lazard, Evercore To Help Boeing Analyze Govt Aid, Potential Funding From Private Market- WSJ', 'text': ':BOEING HAS TAPPED INVESTMENT BANKS FOR HELP SECURING A FINANCIAL LIFELINE'}{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2020-04-10 14:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Moody's Says Downgrades Boeing's Senior Unsecured Rating To Baa2, Outlook To Negative", 'text': 'MOODY\'S SAYS AFFIRMED BOEING\'S PRIME-2 SHORT-TERM RATING.MOODY\'S SAYS DOWNGRADES BOEING\'S SENIOR UNSECURED RATING TO BAA2, OUTLOOK TO NEGATIVE.MOODY\'S SAYS DOWNGRADES REFLECT EXPECTED ADDITIONAL STRAIN ON BOEING\'S FINANCIAL PERFORMANCE, BALANCE SHEET IN UPCOMING YEARS.MOODY\'S SAYS "CORONAVIRUS IS LIKELY TO BECOME A SIGNIFICANTLY GREATER PRESSURE POINT ON BOEING THAN THE LONG-RUNNING 737 MAX CRISIS".MOODY\'S SAYS BOEING IS VULNERABLE TO IMPACT OF COVID-19 ON DEMAND FOR COMMERCIAL AIRCRAFT, RELATED SERVICES & NOW INTERRUPTIONS OF MANUFACTURING OPERATIONS.MOODY\'S SAYS NOW ESTIMATE EXTERNAL FUNDING NEEDS FOR BOEING IN 2020 TO AT LEAST DOUBLE TO $30 BILLION COMPARED TO OUR PRE-CORONAVIRUS EXPECTATIONS.MOODY\'S, ON BOEING, SAYS NEGATIVE OUTLOOK CAPTURES UNCERTAINTY AROUND DURATION,IMPACT OF COVID-19 PANDEMIC ON GLOBAL ECONOMIC ACTIVITY,AIRCRAFT DEMAND.'}{'symbol': 'CTSH', 'date': '2020-04-10 08:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Cognizant Technology Solutions Withdraws Its 2020 Guidance', 'text': "SEES Q1 REVENUE $4.22 BILLION TO $4.23 BILLION.EXPECTS Q1 REVENUE WITHIN PREVIOUSLY GUIDED RANGE.FINANCIAL PERFORMANCE IN FIRST TWO MONTHS OF QUARTER WAS ON TRACK TO EXCEED PREVIOUS GUIDANCE.COGNIZANT TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS - DURING LATTER PART OF MARCH, COVID-19 INCREASINGLY AFFECTED COGNIZANT'S BUSINESS.LONG-TERM FUNDAMENTALS OF OUR BUSINESS REMAIN STRONG.WITHDRAWING ITS 2020 GUIDANCE THAT WAS PROVIDED ON FEBRUARY 5, 2020.DRAWING DOWN $1.74 BILLION ON ITS REVOLVING CREDIT FACILITY ON MARCH 23.HAS NO SIGNIFICANT DEBT MATURITIES UNTIL 2023.SINCE MARCH 31(ST), COGNIZANT HAS NOT INITIATED ANY NEW SHARE REPURCHASE PROGRAMS.COGNIZANT TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS - WILL PROVIDE THOSE AT ASSOCIATE LEVEL AND BELOW WITH AN ADDITIONAL PAYMENT OF 25% OF THEIR BASE PAY FOR MONTH OF APRIL.COGNIZANT - STANDARDIZED 14 DAYS SICK-LEAVE COVERAGE GLOBALLY FOR COVID-19 CASES/SELF-QUARANTINE WITHOUT IMPACTING OTHER SICK LEAVE/VACATION PROGRAMS.COGNIZANT - Q1 REVENUE IS EXPECTED TO BE $4.22-$4.23 BILLION, UP 2.7-2.9% FROM PRIOR-YEAR QUARTER."}{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2020-04-10 19:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Comerica Announces Moving To A Virtual Meeting For 2020 Annual Meeting Of Shareholders', 'text': 'COMERICA ANNOUNCES MOVING TO A VIRTUAL MEETING FOR 2020 ANNUAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS.'}{'symbol': 'FB', 'date': '2020-04-10 18:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Facebook Says Filed A Lawsuit In Federal Court In California Against Basant Gajjar', 'text': "FACEBOOK - FILED A LAWSUIT IN FEDERAL COURT IN CALIFORNIA AGAINST BASANT GAJJAR.FACEBOOK - GAJJAR VIOLATED FACEBOOK TERMS & POLICIES BY PROVIDING CLOAKING SOFTWARE SERVICES TO CIRCUMVENT AUTOMATED AD REVIEW SYSTEMS.FACEBOOK - LEADCLOAK'S SOFTWARE ALSO TARGETED NUMBER OF TECHNOLOGY COS INCLUDING GOOGLE, OATH, WORDPRESS, SHOPIFY, OTHERS.FACEBOOK - LEADCLOAK'S SOFTWARE USED TO CONCEAL WEBSITES FEATURING SCAMS RELATED TO COVID-19, CRYPTOCURRENCY, PHARMACEUTICALS, DIET PILLS, FAKE NEWS PAGES."}{'symbol': 'NLSN', 'date': '2020-04-10 08:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Nielsen And Scripps Reach Multi-Year Agreement For Measurement Services', 'text': "NIELSEN AND SCRIPPS REACH MULTI-YEAR AGREEMENT FOR MEASUREMENT SERVICES.NIELSEN HOLDINGS PLC - AGREEMENT INCLUDES NIELSEN'S LOCAL TV MEASUREMENT, NIELSEN SCARBOROUGH, NLTV, AD INTEL, ARIANNA AND NIELSEN GRABIX."}{'symbol': 'PFE', 'date': '2020-04-10 08:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Emd Serono And Pfizer Submit Application For Bavencio For First-Line Maintenance Treatment Of Locally Advanced Or Metastatic Urothelial Carcinoma', 'text': 'EMD SERONO AND PFIZER RECEIVE US FDA BREAKTHROUGH THERAPY DESIGNATION AND SUBMIT APPLICATION FOR BAVENCIO® FOR FIRST-LINE MAINTENANCE TREATMENT OF LOCALLY ADVANCED OR METASTATIC UROTHELIAL CARCINOMA.EMD SERONO - APPLICATION IS BASED ON POSITIVE RESULTS FROM AN INTERIM ANALYSIS OF PHASE III JAVELIN BLADDER 100 TRIAL.EMD SERONO - SUPPLEMENTAL BIOLOGICS LICENSE APPLICATION IS BEING REVIEWED BY FDA UNDER ITS REAL-TIME ONCOLOGY REVIEW PILOT PROGRAM.'}{'symbol': 'O', 'date': '2020-04-10 18:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Realty Income Draws $1.20 Billion On Revolving Credit Facility', 'text': 'REALTY INCOME ANNOUNCES FIRST QUARTER 2020 EARNINGS RELEASE DATE, DRAWS $1.20 BILLION ON REVOLVING CREDIT FACILITY, AND WITHDRAWS 2020 GUIDANCE.REALTY INCOME CORP - AS OF APRIL 9, 2020, GIVING EFFECT TO RECENT BORROWINGS, COMPANY HAS A CASH BALANCE OF $1.25 BILLION.'}{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2020-04-10 09:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Sempra Energy Receives All Required Governmental Authorizations For $3.59 Bln Divestiture Of Luz Del Sur In Peru', 'text': 'SEMPRA ENERGY RECEIVES ALL REQUIRED GOVERNMENTAL AUTHORIZATIONS FOR $3.59 BILLION DIVESTITURE OF LUZ DEL SUR IN PERU.SEMPRA ENERGY - SALE OF PERUVIAN BUSINESS EXPECTED TO CLOSE IN APRIL.'}{'symbol': 'STE', 'date': '2020-04-10 13:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'FDA Issues Second Emergency Use Authorization To Decontaminate N95 Respirators', 'text': 'FDA ISSUES SECOND EMERGENCY USE AUTHORIZATION TO DECONTAMINATE N95 RESPIRATORS.FDA - SECOND EUA TO SUPPORT DECONTAMINATION OF ABOUT 750,000 N95 RESPIRATORS PER DAY IN U.S..FDA - GRANTED AN EMERGENCY USE AUTHORIZATION TO STERIS CORPORATION FOR STERIS V-PRO 1 PLUS, MAX AND MAX2 LOW TEMPERATURE STERILIZATION SYSTEMS.'}{'symbol': 'TPR', 'date': '2020-04-10 09:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Tapestry Inc Has Extended Store Closures In N.A. And Europe For An Additional Two Weeks', 'text': "TAPESTRY, INC. PROVIDES COVID-19 OPERATIONAL UPDATE.TAPESTRY INC - HAS EXTENDED STORE CLOSURES IN NORTH AMERICA AND EUROPE FOR AN ADDITIONAL TWO WEEKS.TAPESTRY INC - ACROSS ALL THREE BRANDS, ESSENTIALLY ALL OF COMPANY'S STORES IN CHINA HAVE RE-OPENED.TAPESTRY INC - IN SOUTH KOREA, ALL STORES HAVE RESUMED NORMAL OPERATING HOURS.TAPESTRY - MOST OF CO'S GLOBAL DISTRIBUTION CENTERS CONTINUE TO OPERATE WITH ONLY ONE IN MALAYSIA, A THIRD PARTY FACILITY IN NEW JERSEY TEMPORARILY CLOSED.TAPESTRY INC - OVER PAST WEEKS, MANY OTHER STORES HAVE BEEN CLOSED IN ASIA PACIFIC REGION.TAPESTRY - CUSTOMERS CAN CONTINUE TO SHOP THROUGH CO'S E-COMMERCE PLATFORMS ACROSS ALL BRANDS AND REGIONS."}{'symbol': 'UAL', 'date': '2020-04-10 18:30:00-04:56', 'title': "United Airlines Holdings Says CEO Oscar Munoz's 2019 Total Compensation Was $12.6 Mln Versus $10.5 Mln In 2018", 'text': "UNITED AIRLINES HOLDINGS INC - CEO OSCAR MUNOZ'S 2019 TOTAL COMPENSATION WAS $12.6 MILLION VERSUS $10.5 MILLION IN 2018.UNITED AIRLINES HOLDINGS INC - PRESIDENT J. SCOTT KIRBY'S 2019 TOTAL COMPENSATION WAS $16.8 MILLION, INCLUDING $9.7 MILLION IN OPTION AWARDS.UNITED AIRLINES HOLDINGS INC - 2019 CEO PAY RATIO ESTIMATED TO BE 169 TO 1."}{'symbol': 'UNH', 'date': '2020-04-10 09:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'HHS To Begin Immediate Delivery Of Initial $30 Billion Of Cares Act Provider Relief Funding', 'text': 'HHS - TO BEGIN IMMEDIATE DELIVERY OF INITIAL $30 BILLION OF CARES ACT PROVIDER RELIEF FUNDING.HHS - PARTNERING WITH UNITEDHEALTH TO DELIVER INITIAL $30 BILLION DISTRIBUTION OF CARES ACT PROVIDER RELIEF FUNDING TO PROVIDERS AS QUICKLY AS POSSIBLE.'}{'symbol': 'UHS', 'date': '2020-04-10 08:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Universal Health Services Says CEO Alan Miller's FY 2019 Total Compensation Was $24.5 Mln Vs $23.6 Mln In FY 2018", 'text': "UNIVERSAL HEALTH SERVICES INC SAYS CEO ALAN MILLER'S FY 2019 TOTAL COMPENSATION WAS $24.5 MILLION VERSUS $23.6 MILLION IN FY 2018 - SEC FILING.UNIVERSAL HEALTH SERVICES INC SAYS FOR 2019, CEO PAY RATIO WAS 629:1."}{'symbol': 'VRSK', 'date': '2020-04-10 19:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Global Oil Demand To Fall Over 8 Mb/d Y-o-Y For Q2 - Wood Mackenzie', 'text': 'EXPECTS WORLD OIL DEMAND TO FALL OVER 8 MILLION BARRELS PER DAY YEAR-ON-YEAR FOR Q2 2020.SAYS APRIL WILL SEE THE SHARPEST DEMAND DROP, WITH A YEAR-ON-YEAR DECLINE OF OVER 15 MILLION BARRELS PER DAY DUE TO CORONAVIRUS CONTAINMENT MEASURES .SAYS THE SECOND HALF OF 2020 WILL SEE A GRADUAL EASING OF THE EXTREME OVERSUPPLY SEEN IN THE FIRST HALF OF THE YEAR AS THE FUNDAMENTALS BEGIN TO SHIFT TOWARDS DEMAND STABILIZATION.FORECASTS TOTAL GLOBAL SUPPLY, INCLUDING OPEC, NON-OPEC, AND NATURAL GAS LIQUIDS, TO SHOW NO GROWTH FOR 2021.SAYS DEMAND, WHILE WEAK, IS PROJECTED TO RISE IN 2021 .SAYS A 10 MILLION BARRELS PER DAY OIL OUTPUT CUT WOULD BE VERY SUPPORTIVE OF PRICE OVER THE SECOND QUARTER.SAYS IT WOULD SLOW THE BUILD-UP IN STORAGE AND AVOID THE SURPLUS OF SUPPLY OVER THE SECOND QUARTER.'}{'symbol': 'V', 'date': '2020-04-10 04:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'UK watchdog confirms overdraft relief measures during pandemic', 'text': 'By Huw Jones:FCA CONFIRMS TEMPORARY FINANCIAL RELIEF FOR CUSTOMERS IMPACTED BY CORONAVIRUS.FOLLOWING A SHORT CONSULTATION FCA WILL BE GOING AHEAD WITH PROPOSALS OUTLINED LAST WEEK.FCA SAYS CUSTOMERS SHOULD THINK CAREFULLY BEFORE MAKING USE OF THESE MEASURES AND ONLY DO SO IF THEY NEED IMMEDIATE HELP.FCA: WE WILL BE ANNOUNCING FURTHER MEASURES TO SUPPORT CONSUMERS IN OTHER PARTS OF CREDIT MARKET IN FUTURE, INCLUDING IN MOTOR FINANCE SECTOR NEXT WEEK.'}